{"id":277,"title":{"romaji":"Beyblade Burst","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"beyblade_burst","synopsis":"This is the story of a group of passionate Bladers who follow their dreams on an unforgettable journey to the top.\n\n Valt Aoi is crazy about Beyblade. Valt's best friend since childhood, Shu Kurenai, is hailed as a Beyblade prodigy and has already been named as one of the National Beyblade Tournament's Final Four. Inspired by Shu's accomplishments, Valt sets his sights on reaching this year's national tournament. But to get to the big leagues, he must first emerge victorious from the district tournament – no easy feat, given the tough opponents standing in his way. Determined to win, Valt aims to make it to the championship, where he hopes to battle Shu and move on to the national tournament. As he battles, Valt broadens his circle of friends and reaches new heights. Without even realizing it, he has begun to dream of becoming the best Blader in the world.\n\n(Source: Beyblade US site)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:32","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 00:30:19","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":31049},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21236},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":11113},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11291},{"site":"ANN","externalId":17992},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7282},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":80202539},{"site":"AMAZON_PRIME_VIDEO","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":553,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/bnVTnk4Efj8tqRDmWrdb1PmL3AcXmDHrIVNEAG34.jpg"},{"id":554,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/mWfTyXrA7C35NZTzYW3gwAErDFrOZFOSoIyxw0bx.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":5,"name":"OLM","slug":"olm"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":13,"name":"Beyblade","slug":"beyblade"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":6961,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":6961,"title":{"romaji":"Burst Fi